# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
/target/

# Generated native projects — `npm run ios:init` recreates all of it from
# tauri.conf.json. Ignored rather than committed because the generated
# project.pbxproj carries DEVELOPMENT_TEAM, which is per-developer and belongs
# in .env (see .env.example), not in the repository. Anything hand-written for
# the native side would have to move out of gen/ before this could change.
/gen/
